    "**%@** came in. Was it income, a loan to you, or someone paying you back?": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ໄດ້ຮັບ **%@** — ເປັນລາຍຮັບ, ເງິນທີ່ຢືມມາ ຫຼື ມີຄົນສົ່ງເງິນຄືນເຈົ້າ?"
          }
        },
        "th": {
