    "Moonee doesn't see a receipt, transfer or bill in that photo, so nothing was saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moonee ບໍ່ເຫັນໃບບິນ, ການໂອນເງິນ ຫຼື ໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ໃນຮູບນີ້, ເລີຍຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກຫຍັງ"
          }
